Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:51.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《星际迷航9：起义》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.98,0:01:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里！抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is! Let's get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.64,0:01:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.02,0:03:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,验证物化序列\N{\fnArial\fs30}Verifying materialization sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在12号雷达上清晰显像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring up resolution on radar unit 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.48,0:03:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 七区呼叫指挥部 - 请讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Area 7 to Command. - Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.90,0:03:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这边需要增添人手 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could use another survey team out here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.99,0:03:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地呼叫麦康利少尉和吉儿少尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Base to Ensign McCauley and Ensign Gilles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,请前往第七区 协助土壤勘探组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please report to Area 7 and assist the edaphology team.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.16,0:03:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把资料输入二级处理器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transferring anthropometric data files to secondary processor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 人种研究表明97%… - 星球生态分析…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ethnographic studies indicate 97%… - The ecological analysis…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在比对中…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still working on correlating that unidentified…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.05,0:03:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,对比语言分析已完成 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}The comparative linguistic analysis is complete, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.97,0:03:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,多尔蒂将军正等它呢 传到飞船上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Dougherty is waiting for this. Transmit it to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报！第十二区！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alert! Area 12!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.82,0:04:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个机器人失去控制了 - 报告情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The android, he's out of control. - Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.57,0:04:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他冲着村子里去了 我们正试着拦住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's headed toward the village. We're trying to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那边！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,放大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnify.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？出什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地呼叫数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Base to Commander Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.23,0:04:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,修改微型液压分配\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rerouting micro-hydraulic power distribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 调节热量超负荷 - 数据 立即向基地汇报！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Regulating thermal overload. - Data, report to Base immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备正电子矩阵功能 启动二级协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transferring positronic matrix functions. Engaging secondary protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要拿掉头盔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's trying to remove the headpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有单位 拦截这个机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All field units, intercept the android.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.05,0:05:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿添 阿添 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artim, Artim, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.89,0:05:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,进屋去 快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get inside. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.90,0:05:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快找掩护 大伙快进屋 快点儿 赶快回去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find shelter. Everyone, get inside. Now. Back to your homes! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.78,0:05:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！回家去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,二级协议启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secondary protocol is active.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们看见他了 - 拦住他！快点儿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They can see him. - Stop him! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.26,0:05:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据中校 快点退后 这是命令！重复 赶快退后！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Data, stand down. That's an order! I repeat, stand down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是什么人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.40,0:06:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一颗M级星球 人口总数三亿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an M-Class planet. Population, 300 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再说一遍问候语？- 尤金且佛儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Say the greeting again. - Yew-cheen chef-faw.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,「金」音和「佛」两个字要重读\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emphasis on the "cheen" and the "faw."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.04,0:07:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么换件制服要么换个脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You either need a new uniform or a new neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上军校后领子尺寸就没变过\N{\fnArial\fs30}My collar size is exactly as it was at the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.63,0:07:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.84,0:07:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,客人们已经到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our guests have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.96,0:07:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在大吃餐桌上的装饰花呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are eating the floral arrangements on the banquet tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.51,0:07:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们饭前大概不喝鸡尾酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess they don't believe in cocktails before dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！他们是素食者？资料上没写？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! Are they vegetarian? That's not in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.39,0:07:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们该叫厨师赶做一份酸辣酱油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we should have the chef whip up a light balsamic vinaigrette,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,浇在菊花上会非差好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}something that goes well with chrysanthemums.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.98,0:07:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 舰桥呼叫船长 - 说吧 少尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bridge to Captain Picard. - Go ahead, Ensign.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥部问我们何时抵达哥伦星系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command wants to know our ETA at the Goren system.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.53,0:07:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥伦星系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Goren system?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要我们去调解领空纠纷\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need us to mediate some territorial dispute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.91,0:07:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能耽误去汉伦二号星的考古勘察\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't delay the archeological expedition to Hanoran II.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.41,0:07:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就会赶上季风期\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll put us right in the middle of the monsoon season.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 船长 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,外交团正忙着和自治领谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}The diplomatic corps is busy with Dominion negotiations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对 所以就派我们去做和事佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. So they need us to put out one more brush fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁还会记得我们的专长是去探险？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can anyone remember when we used to be explorers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第十层 - 尤金且佛儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Deck 10. - Yew-cheen chef-faw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.68,0:07:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,记着 他们的科技远远没有我们先进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, they have a significantly less advanced technology than ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.22,0:08:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去年才发明出曲翘推进器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They only achieved warp drive last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦这么快就决定让他们成为保护国\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Federation Council decided to make them a protectorate so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于失去了博格人和自治领\N{\fnArial\fs30}In view of our losses to the Borg and the Dominion,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.73,0:08:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以议会的委员们觉得我们该多找些盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Council feels we need all the allies we can get these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.61,0:08:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain on deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得邀请古莎亲王跳支舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be expected to dance with the Regent Cuzar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.21,0:08:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她会跳曼波舞吗？- 真幽默\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can she mambo? - Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长以前是舞林高手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Captain used to cut quite a rug.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.75,0:08:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉弗吉呼叫皮卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}La Forge to Picard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.96,0:08:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 我有事情要汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, I need to talk to you before the reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 船长 医生 - 亲爱的胡夫先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain. Doctor. - Mr. Worf!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.09,0:08:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胡夫 - 你跑这儿来干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Worf. - What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 本来我是在在曼扎检查新的防卫设施… - 稍等一会 佐迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was at the Manzar colony… - He's a little late, Geordi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.34,0:08:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以等吗？- 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can it wait? - I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦对不起 告诉他我已经来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Tell him that I'm already here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他来了我们再谈 胡夫先生 我对…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll talk to him when he arrives. Mr. Worf, I have…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐迪 船长请你上这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geordi, the Captain would like you to come up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.69,0:08:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他我们收到了多尔蒂上将的讯息 跟数据有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him we've received a communiqué from Admiral Dougherty. It's about Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金且佛儿 古莎亲王 欢迎莅临企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yew-cheen chef-faw, Regent Cuzar. Welcome aboard the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.91,0:09:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮卡特船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Picard,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.25,0:09:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我用我国人民的仪式欢迎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}may I welcome you in the time- honored tradition of my people?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.89,0:09:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很荣幸能被庞大的联邦家族所接纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are so honored to be accepted within the great Federation family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 相信稍后您会赏脸和我跳支舞的 - 乐意之至\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have a dance later, I believe. - I look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.44,0:09:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 顾问 - 很漂亮的珠子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Counselor. - Nice bead work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 对不起 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain. Excuse me. Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,多尔蒂上将正在441区一艘桑那人的船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, Admiral Dougherty is aboard a Son'a ship in Sector 441.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他想要数据的设计图 - 出了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's requesting Data's schematics. - Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.33,0:09:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,信息上没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The message doesn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据该回来了才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data should have been back by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划在巴库村庄只观察一星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were only scheduled to observe the Ba'ku village for one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐迪 请在休息室帮我接通上将的保密通讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geordi, would you set up a secure comm link with the Admiral in the anteroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 我叫哈斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, Hars Adislo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去年在纳尔巴托会议上见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We met at the Nel Bato Conference last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有看过我写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever have a chance to read my paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于热离子跨导的论文？\N{\fnArial\fs30}on thermionic transconductance?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.31,0:10:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先失陪一下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不承认任何星际舰队的通讯协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not acknowledging any Starfleet protocols,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们的呼叫也没有反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}not responding to any of our hails.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.24,0:10:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为是什么原因导致了这种行为？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you any idea what precipitated this behavior?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 他现在把我们的人扣押在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}None. Now he's holding our people hostage down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.00,0:10:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业号两天后就能到你那，将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the Enterprise could be at your position in two days, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.75,0:10:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能不是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's probably not a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.79,0:10:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的飞船并不适应这块地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your ship hasn't been fitted for this region.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这区的环境相当特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are environmental concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么个特别法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of concerns?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没有完全确认它的异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't fully identified the anomalies yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把这一带叫做荆棘区\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're calling this whole area the Briar Patch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们花了一天时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took us a day to reach a location.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,才才抵达能够进行通讯的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we could even get a signal to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,把数据的设计图给我就是了 有情况我再通知你 通讯完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get me Data's schematics. I'll keep you informed. Dougherty out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.57,0:10:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的情绪晶片？- 他根本就没带\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His emotion chip? - He didn't take it with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把设计图发给将军 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Send the Admiral Data's schematics. - Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.49,0:11:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事？- 少尉 你能去一趟厨房\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir? - Ensign, would you report to the galley.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉厨师跳过吃鱼这个过程吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell the chef to skip the fish course?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽快而又不失礼的招待完这些客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like our guests to depart as soon as etiquette allows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.46,0:11:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会叫胡夫暂时留下来 先不回深空9号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to ask Worf to delay his return to DS9 so that he can join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去哥伦星系的路上 顺便去一趟441区\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna stop by Sector 441 on our way to the Goren system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这两个地点方向完全相反 长官 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They are in opposite directions, sir. - Are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始我就不该听你的话建什么隐形掩体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never should have let you talk me into that duck blind in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的联邦程序是使完成这次任务的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Federation procedures have made this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.29,0:11:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,难度增加了十倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}ten times as difficult as it needed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的程序是为了避免当地居民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our procedures were in place to protect the planet's population.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇到不必要的危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}from unnecessary risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.09,0:12:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地居民只有600人而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Planet's population, 600 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想避免不必要的危险 那下次就别带你的机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to avoid unnecessary risks, next time, leave your android at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.39,0:12:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰桥呼叫罗阿佛将军 我们正靠近星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridge to Ahdar Ru'afo. We are approaching the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.60,0:12:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入高空轨道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us into a high orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.98,0:12:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺下吧 将军 姑娘们能让你年轻二十岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lie down, Admiral. The girls'll take 20 years off your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.61,0:12:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下次再说吧 - 你的自制让我困惑 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Another time, perhaps. - Your self-restraint puzzles me, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在拒绝这次任务给你带来的各种好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}You continue to deny yourself every benefit this mission has to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更愿意等到和联邦的全体人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer to wait until we can share the benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起分享这些好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all the people of the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 报告情况 - 死光枪 来源不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Report. - Phaser blast. Unknown origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动防护罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.01,0:12:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离开运行轨道 - 光子鱼雷 准备撞击\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take us out of orbit. - Photon torpedoes. Brace for impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.98,0:13:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 已经摆脱敌人的追击 长官 - 打开屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The vessel has broken off pursuit, sir. - Visual contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.15,0:13:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.09,0:13:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 我们马上将会和星际舰队失去联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, we're about to lose all communications with Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.05,0:13:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经拿到所有资料了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have everything you need from Command?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经下载了掩体任务和桑那人所有的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've downloaded all the files on the duck blind mission and the Son'a.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你两天时间弄清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have two days to become experts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.73,0:13:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡夫 我们的任务是设法安全的抓住数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Worf, our job is to come up with a plan to safely capture Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经让拉弗吉中校设计了这个三相器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already had Commander La Forge modify this tricorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.99,0:13:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,来控制数据的伺服器\N{\fnArial\fs30}with one of Data's actuation servos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.41,0:13:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的有效范围只有四米 但是能把它关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its operational range is only 4 meters, but it will shut him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.41,0:13:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你回来 胡夫先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to have you back, Mr. Worf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.25,0:14:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,速度降到三分之一 出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow to one-third. Take us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.10,0:14:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,半个世纪前 他们征服了两个原始部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half a century ago, they conquered two primitive races,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.31,0:14:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔拉族和艾拉瑞安族\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Tarlac and the Ellora,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.77,0:14:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸纳并且奴役他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then integrated them into their culture as a labor class.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.49,0:14:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑那人是以生产大量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Son'a are known to have produced.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.32,0:14:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以迷幻心智的毒药而闻名\N{\fnArial\fs30}mass quantities of the narcotic ketracel-white.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说他们的飞船上装备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their ships are rumored to be equipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.29,0:14:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇托姆协议所禁止的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with isolytic subspace weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,同位线子空间武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}outlawed by the Second Khitomer Accord.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么跟这帮人扯上了关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would we be involved with these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.97,0:14:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好久没这样了 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You haven't done that in a long time. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.97,0:14:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弄我的脖子 - 我在弄你的脖子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What you're doing to my neck. - Was I doing something to your neck?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.31,0:15:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰桥呼叫胡夫中校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridge to Commander Worf.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.82,0:15:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胡夫！- 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Worf! - Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道在深空9号上是怎么规定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how they do it on Deep Space Nine,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.82,0:15:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过在企业号 我们必须准时向长官报到\N{\fnArial\fs30}but on the Enterprise, we still report for duty on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 船长 我就来 - 这次就先饶了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, sir. I'm on my way. - We'll skip the court-martial this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,通讯结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picard out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.21,0:15:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,转矩感应器是什么时候调校的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time we aligned the torque sensors?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两个月前 长官 - 好像有误差\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two months ago, sir. - They don't sound right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.68,0:15:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,传感器确实有误差 可是只有12微米\N{\fnArial\fs30}The torque sensors are out of alignment by 12 microns.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能听出来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.52,0:15:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我年轻的时侯连3微米误差也听得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was an ensign, I could detect a three- micron misalignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下 长官 上将所在飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir. The Son'a ship with Admiral Dougherty aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.23,0:15:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,已进入显像范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}has entered tracking range.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,整理一下仪容 中校 打开屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straighten your baldric, Commander. On screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 我没想到你会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, I wasn't expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:16:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事很重要 我们不能袖手旁观 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is too important for the Enterprise to be on the sidelines, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜我没有好消息奉告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I had better news.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据昨天攻击了我们的任务侦察船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Data attacked us in a mission scout ship yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.42,0:16:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和罗阿佛已经决定派出作战小队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ru'afo and I have decided to send in an assault team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡夫队长和我已经在研究可行的战术计划…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Worf and I are working on several tactical plans to see…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.22,0:16:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的机器人已经极为危险 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your android has turned dangerously violent, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的飞船受到了损失 必须摧毁它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considerable damage was done to my ship. He must be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.89,0:16:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道数据对星际舰队很重要 吉恩·卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what Data means to Starfleet, Jean-Luc,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.31,0:16:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他和巴库人扣押着我们的船员\N{\fnArial\fs30}but our crew is at the mercy of those people on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们没有办法活捉数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}If our first attempt to capture Data fails,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.24,0:16:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会亲手消毁他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will terminate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的责任 我是他船长也是他的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be the one to do it. I'm his captain and his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.62,0:16:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 给你十二个小时 之后你就得离开荆棘区\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you have 12 hours, Captain. Then I want you out of the Briar Patch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时 如果你失败了的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime, we'll head out to the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.09,0:16:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事就交给桑那援军处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}to call for Son'a reinforcements in case you fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.42,0:16:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白 - 祝你好运 船长 通讯完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Understood. - Good luck, Captain. Dougherty out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.86,0:17:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,传感器显示没有飞船从星球表面飞过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sensors are not picking up any ships coming from the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,发出宽幅变量讯号 应该能引起他的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transmit a wideband covariant signal. That ought to get his attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.95,0:17:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定是利用星环掩护行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must be using the planet's rings to mask his approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.45,0:17:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,星环发出的重曲辐射正处于最强状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}The metaphasic radiation from the rings is in a state of extreme flux.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.83,0:17:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得避开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll steer clear of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.79,0:17:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来 不管你在哪 快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out, come out, wherever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.13,0:17:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.13,0:17:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是小时候我妈妈…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's something that my mother…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.30,0:17:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.02,0:17:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开所有通讯频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open all hailing frequencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据 我是皮卡特船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data, this is Captain Picard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据 请答话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data, please respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.37,0:18:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果发射超光速粒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we fire tachyon bursts,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.53,0:18:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就得调整护盾的调波\N{\fnArial\fs30}it might force him to reset his shield harmonics.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.66,0:18:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 趁着他调校 把他给传送过来 - 就这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When he does, we can beam him out. - Make it so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接命中 他正在调整护盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Direct hit. He's resetting his shield harmonics.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.63,0:18:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他传送过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beam him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.89,0:18:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他启动了反传送装置 - 准备进入大气层\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He has activated a transport inhibitor. - Prepare to enter the atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.98,0:18:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们利用电离层边界来摆脱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll use the ionospheric boundary to shake him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.73,0:18:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫描仪失灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scanners are off-line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.36,0:18:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入逃逸状态 方向140-31\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evasive maneuvers, heading 1-4-0 mark 3-1.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.05,0:19:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能驾驶飞船 他还知道怎么运用战略\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can fly a ship. He can anticipate tactical strategies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.39,0:19:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 他的大脑仍在运行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly his brain is functioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.23,0:19:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然他这么能应对危险 我想看看他怎么应对…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've seen how he responds to threats. I wonder how he would respond…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.94,0:19:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡夫 你知道吉尔伯特和沙利文吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Worf, do you know Gilbert and Sullivan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 长官 我回来以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, I have not had a chance to meet all the new crew members.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有来得及认识所有的新船员\N{\fnArial\fs30}since I have been back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.78,0:19:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是作曲拍档 是十九世纪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're composers, Worf, from the 19th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据在出发之前一直在练习他们的作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data was rehearsing a production of H.M.S. Pinafore just before he left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国水手豪情万丈\N{\fnArial\fs30}A British tar is a soaring soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.55,0:19:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,海阔天空 自由奔放\N{\fnArial\fs30}As free as a mountain bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.47,0:19:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,磨拳擦掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}His energetic fist should be ready to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.93,0:19:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对抗强权\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dictatorial word.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.27,0:19:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起唱 胡夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sing, Worf, sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的鼻孔扩张\N{\fnArial\fs30}His nose should pant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.94,0:19:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的嘴角上翘\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his lip should curl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的面颊透焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}His cheeks should flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.11,0:19:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的眉宇轩昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his brow should furl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.94,0:19:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的胸膛起伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}His bosom should heave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.57,0:20:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的心意光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his heart should glow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,虎拳一出 敌人立即倒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his fist be ever ready for a knockdown blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的鼻孔扩张 嘴角上翘\N{\fnArial\fs30}His nose should pant and his lip should curl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的面颊透焰 眉宇轩昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}His cheeks should flame and his brow should furl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.50,0:20:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的胸膛起伏 心意光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}His bosom should heave and his heart should glow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,虎拳一出 敌人立即倒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his fist be ever ready for a knockdown blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.63,0:20:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好衔接钳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare the docking clamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.67,0:20:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的眼睛闪出怒火\N{\fnArial\fs30}His eyes should flash with an inborn fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.01,0:20:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,眉宇流露藐视神情\N{\fnArial\fs30}His brow with scorn be wrung.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.01,0:20:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不为强权而屈服\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never should bow down to a domineering frown.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.18,0:20:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会为独裁者发言 - 不会为独裁者发言\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or the tang of a tyrant tongue - Or the tang of a tyrant tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的心灵破碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}His heart should stamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.19,0:20:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的怒声不断\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his throat should growl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.98,0:20:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的头发卷曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}His hair should curl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.65,0:20:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的脸孔绷着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his face should scowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.32,0:20:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的目光发怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}His eyes should flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.94,0:20:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的胸膛挺起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his breast protrude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.65,0:20:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他一贯的姿势\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this should be his customary attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在顿脚 把声线压低\N{\fnArial\fs30}His foot should stamp and his throat should growl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.12,0:20:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的头发卷曲他的脸孔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}His hair should curl and his face…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.88,0:20:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,组合惯性超出负荷量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inertial coupling is exceeding tolerance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.13,0:21:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果再不放开它 两艘船会同归于尽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we do not release him, he may destroy both vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不放开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not letting go of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.51,0:21:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须加强减震场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must stabilize the damping field.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.97,0:21:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把应急动力传到惯性减震器上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reroute emergency power to inertial dampers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.52,0:21:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动程序中弹失灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The auto- sequencer was damaged by phaser fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入手动操控状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transferring controls to manual.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.03,0:21:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动程序重新调整 启动减震器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power sequence realigned. Engaging stabilizers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.03,0:21:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 减震器已经启动了 - 最大动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damping field established. - Maximum power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.13,0:21:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动 胡夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Mr. Worf.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.98,0:21:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 数据中校被安全抓获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, Commander Data is safely in custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.72,0:22:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 我叫加利天 桑那的指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, Subahdar Gallatin, Son'a Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.19,0:22:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是上将的武官柯蒂斯上尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him we've received a communiqué from Admiral Dougherty. It's about Data.Lieutenant Curtis, \Nattaché to Admiral Dougherty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.73,0:22:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们没事吧？- 他们对我们很友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you all right? - We've been treated extremely well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.03,0:22:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的智力非常发达 洞察力很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have incredible mental discipline, clarity of perception.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.61,0:22:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫苏捷 - 吉恩·卢克·皮卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My name is Sojef. - Jean-Luc Picard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.87,0:22:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的船员 赫医生 蔡顾问\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are my officers, Dr. Crusher, Counselor Troi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.95,0:23:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们要吃点什么吗？- 不 我们是来营救他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you like something to eat? - No, we're here to rescue them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.96,0:23:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你们 不过我希望你们能够解除武装\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish, but I would ask you to disarm yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.30,0:23:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这不希望见到武力\N{\fnArial\fs30}This village is a sanctuary of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.10,0:23:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备把人质传送到飞船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare the hostages for transport to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.48,0:23:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在跟船员接触之前 得先把他们隔离\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should be quarantined before joining the ship's population.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们收到消息说 他们是被挟持在这的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were under the impression they were being held against their will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.45,0:23:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本不希望有外人来打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not our custom to have guests here at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.91,0:23:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不要说挟持他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}let alone hold anyone against their will.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.95,0:23:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一名机器人不让他们离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The artificial life- form would not allow them to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.99,0:23:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 他说这些人使我们的敌人 而且还有更多的敌人要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, he told us they were our enemies and that more would follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.75,0:23:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们是敌人吗？- 安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you our enemy? - Anij.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.17,0:23:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的政策就是不干涉其他文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}My people have a strict policy of non- interference in other cultures.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.75,0:23:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的首要指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our Prime Directive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.67,0:23:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然你们的指令不包括偷窥其他文明吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your directive apparently doesn't include spying on other cultures.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.68,0:23:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉那个机器人是我的船员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The artificial life- form is a member of my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.52,0:24:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然 他出了故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, he was taken ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.68,0:24:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的正电子矩阵出现了相位差误\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a phase variance in his positronic matrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.35,0:24:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没办法修理\N{\fnArial\fs30}which we were unable to repair.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.82,0:24:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来这位船长不大相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the Captain finds it hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.82,0:24:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会有修理正电子仪器的技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we'd have any skills repairing a positronic device.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.20,0:24:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的技术水平不太明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our technological abilities are not apparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.45,0:24:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我们在日常生活中避免使用它们尽量避免使用科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we have chosen not to employ them in our daily lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.66,0:24:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相信 如果以机械取代人力的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe that when you create a machine to do the work of a man,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.00,0:24:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等于剥夺了部分人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}you take something away from the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.96,0:24:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前像你们一样探索过太空\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at one time, we explored the galaxy, just as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.29,0:24:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们拥有曲翘技术？- 技术当然是有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have warp capability? - Capability, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.71,0:24:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可曲翘推进只会带我们远离这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But where can warp drive take us except away from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.90,0:24:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对我们的闯入万分抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize for our intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.74,0:24:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们拥有曲翘技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}And because they have warp capability,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.24,0:25:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们所造成的影响并不是很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}the consequences to their society will be minimal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.87,0:25:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得很好 吉恩·卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done a terrific job, Jean-Luc.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.04,0:25:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快收拾行李 离开这鬼地方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now pack your bags and get the hell out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.67,0:25:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Data?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.09,0:25:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,被关闭了 拉吉夫正在给他检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}In stasis. La Forge is completing the diagnostic.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.55,0:25:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把文件准备好 我们你回来的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll need all your paperwork tomorrow. We're heading back your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.63,0:25:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定路线跟我们会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set a course to rendezvous with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.97,0:25:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在离开的时候给我们把将船员和装备传送过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can transfer the crew and equipment on your way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.47,0:25:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还没结束？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not finished here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.35,0:25:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有些工作要收尾 通讯完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a few loose ends to tie up. Dougherty out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.76,0:25:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.05,0:26:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 有空吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - You got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.26,0:26:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.48,0:26:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想进行咨询\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a little counseling.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.48,0:26:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都有第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's a first time for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.56,0:26:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是躺下还是怎么着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, do I lie down or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.98,0:26:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你 怎么舒服就怎么来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever makes you comfortable,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.28,0:26:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这可不是正常的医疗姿势\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this isn't one of the usual therapeutic postures.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.07,0:26:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但这样得舒服 - 你干嘛不坐起来试试？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But it is comfortable. - Why don't you try sitting up?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.79,0:26:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛不躺下试试？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you try lying down?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.71,0:26:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你今天心情很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're in quite a mood today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.58,0:26:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是来咨询的还是来玩的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really need counseling or did you come down here to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.71,0:26:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想我出现了中年危机 - 我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think I'm having a midlife crisis. - I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.76,0:26:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sleeping well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.97,0:26:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫医生有办法治好你的病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Crusher has something that can take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.26,0:26:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫医生治不了我的心病\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I need, I can't get from Dr. Crusher.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.89,0:26:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,顾问 你觉得我们两个人有没有可能弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}Counselor, do you think it's possible for two people to go back in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.35,0:26:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前犯下的错误？\N{\fnArial\fs30}fix a mistake they've made?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.19,0:26:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在企业号上 什么都有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}On this ship, anything's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.40,0:26:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好扎！- 好扎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yuck! - Yuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.86,0:27:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我从没吻过有胡子的你 - 我吻你 你却说「好刺」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I never kissed you with a beard before. - I kiss you and you say "yuck"?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.75,0:27:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我重建了数据的神经网 取出了这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to reconstruct Data's neural net and replace these.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.00,0:27:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面存储了记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}They contain memory engrams.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.46,0:27:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么损坏的？- 桑那人的枪打的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How were they damaged? - By a Son'a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.80,0:27:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 这才是数据出现故障的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no doubt about it, Captain. That's what caused Data to malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.47,0:27:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是桑那人说是数据发生故障之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the Son'a report claims that they didn't fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.59,0:27:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们才的开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}until after he malfunctioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.93,0:27:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不认为情况是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't believe it happened that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.93,0:27:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们干嘛无故冲他开枪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they fire on him without provocation?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.27,0:27:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道他在中枪之前是很正常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is that he was functioning normally until he was shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.02,0:27:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,中枪后 故障保护程序就启动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then his fail- safe system was activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.57,0:27:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,故障保护？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fail-safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.73,0:27:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的道德程序接管了所有基本功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}His ethical and moral subroutines took over all of his basic functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.82,0:27:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说他仍然\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're saying that he still knew the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.61,0:27:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够分辨是非\N{\fnArial\fs30}between right and wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.82,0:27:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只能够分辨是非\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a sense, that's all he knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.49,0:27:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这程序是用来防止\N{\fnArial\fs30}The system is designed to protect Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.03,0:27:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人趁数据失忆的时候来利用他\N{\fnArial\fs30}against anyone who might try to take advantage of his memory loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.62,0:27:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他袭击我们 还告诉巴库人我们是威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet he attacked us, and he told the Ba'ku that we were a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.67,0:27:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 假眼不舒服？- 没什么 可能是太累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are the implants bothering you? - I'm all right. I think I'm just tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.31,0:28:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佐迪？船长？- 你在企业号上 数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Geordi? Captain? - You're on the Enterprise, Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.27,0:28:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉自己好像少了几个记忆棒应该是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seem to be missing several memory engrams…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.32,0:28:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.28,0:28:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据 你最后的印象是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data, what's the last thing that you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.58,0:28:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的鼻孔扩张 嘴角上翘\N{\fnArial\fs30}His nose should pant and his lips should curl.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.08,0:28:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟任务有关的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.12,0:28:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时穿着隐形装\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in an isolation suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.54,0:28:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜集巴库星的生理功能资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}gathering physiometric data on the Ba'ku.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.38,0:28:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后的记忆是我跟着孩子们 爬到了山上\N{\fnArial\fs30}My last memory is going into the hills following some children.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.76,0:28:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿添 你还记得那天哪个机器人出现的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artim, do you remember where you were on the day of lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.47,0:28:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在哪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the artificial life- form appeared to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.77,0:28:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 水坝旁边的山上 - 能带我们去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the hills by the dam. - Can you show us?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.29,0:29:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用不着那么怕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no reason to fear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.50,0:29:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在处于正常的运行状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am now operating within normal parameters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.00,0:29:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 因为我被修好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - They fixed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.51,0:29:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 船长 那孩子好像很怕我 - 不是针对你 数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain, the boy is afraid of me. - It's nothing personal, Data.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.22,0:29:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得记住 这里的人排斥科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to remember, these people have rejected technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.77,0:29:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我正好代表着他所排斥的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the personification of everything they have rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.64,0:29:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子以前连机器可能都没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until this week, that young man probably never saw a machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.86,0:29:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,何况会走路会说话的机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}let alone one that walks and talks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.78,0:29:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰桥呼叫大副\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridge to Riker.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.91,0:29:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,能等会儿吗 胡夫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get back to you, Mr. Worf?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.58,0:29:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,多尔蒂上将在线上 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Dougherty is on the comm link, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.62,0:29:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,接进来吧 你好 上将\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patch him through. Yes, Admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.92,0:30:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么还没有离开？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why haven't you left orbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.80,0:30:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮卡特船长还在星球上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Picard is still on the surface, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.76,0:30:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.01,0:30:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要先弄明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't want to leave until we could adequately explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.05,0:30:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据的故障的原因再走\N{\fnArial\fs30}why Data malfunctioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.68,0:30:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要知道想知道数据还可不可靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}His future in Starfleet could depend on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.93,0:30:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒船长 十二小时已经到期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind the Captain his 12 hours are up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.19,0:30:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 长官 - 通讯完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - Dougherty out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.36,0:30:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的身体产生了太多的毒素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your body is producing far too many toxins.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.74,0:30:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经达到了基因处理的极限\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've reached the limit of genetic manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.66,0:30:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要联邦朋友们别在节外生枝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't need anymore genetic manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.79,0:30:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后我就再也不用做基因处理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if our Federation friends will allow us to complete this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.76,0:30:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,山上有大量的凯波石岩层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tricorder functions are limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.09,0:30:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以三相器没法正常工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}due to heavy deposits of kelbonite in these hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.01,0:30:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,用辐射扫描试试？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a passive radiation scan?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.35,0:31:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.77,0:31:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,湖上好像发射出高密度的微中子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There appear to be strong neutrino emissions coming from the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.54,0:31:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他可以在水里呼吸？- 数据不用呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can he breathe underwater? - Data doesn't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.59,0:31:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会生锈吗？- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Won't he rust? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.74,0:31:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长！船长！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain! Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.41,0:32:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我知道是什么在发射微中子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I know what is causing the neutrino emissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.46,0:32:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘分明是联邦的太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vessel is clearly Federation in origin, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.71,0:32:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,「还有一些工作要收尾」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Just a few loose ends to tie up."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.38,0:32:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们对这些事情不感兴趣 - 我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not interested in such things. - I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.14,0:33:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得你最好… - 我要跟着去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think it would be wiser if you didn't… - I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.94,0:33:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一项全息工程\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a holographic projection.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.82,0:33:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过还没有完工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incomplete, I might add.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.62,0:34:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你所看到的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're seeing is a computer-driven image.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.87,0:34:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,由光子和力场形成的电脑图像\N{\fnArial\fs30}created by photons and force fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.87,0:34:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道什么是全息图 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what a hologram is, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.63,0:34:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可为什么有人要制作我们村子的全息图呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, why would anyone want to create one of our village?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.71,0:34:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据 可能是你跟着孩子们 无意中发现了这艘船…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data, if you were following the children and discovered this ship…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.64,0:34:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们朝我开枪是不是为了掩盖这个秘密呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is conceivable, I was shot to protect the secret of its existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.22,0:34:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了想欺骗巴库人外还能有什么原因？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they duplicate this village except to deceive the Ba'ku?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.31,0:34:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想欺骗我们？- 把你们迁离这星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Deceive us? - To move you off this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.90,0:34:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁着你们晚上熟睡的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go to sleep one night in the village,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.15,0:34:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们集体传送到这艘飞船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}wake up the next morning on this flying holodeck, transported en masse.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.32,0:34:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了几天之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within a few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.08,0:34:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就被不知不觉的安置到另一个类似的星球上\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're relocated on a similar planet without ever realizing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.87,0:34:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么联邦或是桑那人要迁走他们呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would the Federation or the Son'a wish to move the Ba'ku?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.00,0:34:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.29,0:35:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑 结束程序 关闭全息图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer, end program. Decloak the vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.59,0:35:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！我不会游泳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! I can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.14,0:35:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.73,0:35:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人向我开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been shot at,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.48,0:35:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把我推下水 又差点被绑架\N{\fnArial\fs30}thrown into the lake out of a ship that's come to abduct us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.40,0:35:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有什么好慌的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's there to panic about?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.07,0:36:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,再出现落水的情况时\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the event of a water landing,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.41,0:36:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以被用作浮水装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been designed to serve as a floatation device.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.08,0:36:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡夫 人质在汇报情况时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Worf, did the hostages mention anything about a cloaked ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.25,0:36:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有提到一艘隐形船只？\N{\fnArial\fs30}during their debriefing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.96,0:36:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 再问问他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, sir. - Debrief them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.42,0:36:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你跟人打架了 胡夫？- 没有 长官 这是个高奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you been in a fight, Mr. Worf? - No, sir. It is a gorch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.97,0:36:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,高奇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gorch?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.14,0:36:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是青春痘 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pimple, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.14,0:36:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 实际上 一点儿都不显眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's hardly noticeable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.25,0:36:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,光滑得像机器人的屁股 是不是 数据？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smooth as an android's bottom, eh, Data?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.33,0:36:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,您说什么 长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg your pardon, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.67,0:36:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,多尔蒂上将问我们为什么还没走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Dougherty wants to know why we haven't left yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.63,0:36:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们哪也不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.30,0:37:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,到5层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deck 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.97,0:37:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们克林冈人什么都长得大 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Klingons never do anything small, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.97,0:37:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫医生叫你回来后跟她联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Crusher asked to speak to you when you returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.60,0:37:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赫医生 - 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Picard to Crusher. - Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.52,0:37:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些桑那人拒绝接受检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Son'a hostages declined to be examined.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.48,0:37:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他们暂时监管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had them confined to quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.28,0:37:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的人呢？- 他们很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And our people? - They're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.99,0:37:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们比很好还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, they're better than fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.65,0:37:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,新陈代谢加快 肌肉结实 精力很充沛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Increased metabolism, improved muscle tone, high energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.82,0:37:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真令人羡慕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should all be so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.99,0:37:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 医生 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well, Doctor. Picard out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.79,0:37:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡夫 等我和罗阿佛谈完话 再释放那些军官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worf, don't release the Son'a officers till I've talked to Ahdar Ru'afo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.00,0:37:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.83,0:37:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,大副 可不可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander, may I…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.47,0:37:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑 给我来点音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer, music.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.55,0:37:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不要这种 要拉丁音乐 - 请指定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. Not that, something Latin. - Specify.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.52,0:37:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼波舞曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mambo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.52,0:38:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才像样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.21,0:38:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多大了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.43,0:38:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在 快要自我毁灭的时候离开了家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came here from a solar system on the verge of self- annihilation,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.60,0:38:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我们的武器足以摧毁星球上所有生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}where technology had created weapons that threatened to destroy all life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.73,0:38:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小群人出发去寻找新的家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}A small group of us set off to find a new home,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.23,0:38:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个远离其他世界威胁的家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}a home that would be isolated from the threats of other worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.95,0:38:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是309年以前的事情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was 309 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.86,0:38:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后你们就不再衰老\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you haven't aged a day since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.37,0:38:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上我们刚来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I was a good deal older when we arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.70,0:38:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,比现在衰老得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}in terms of my physical condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.25,0:38:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴库星的星环\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an unusual metaphasic radiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.58,0:39:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,发出一种不同寻常的重曲辐射\N{\fnArial\fs30}coming from the planet's rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.46,0:39:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能够持续再生我们的基因结构\N{\fnArial\fs30}It continuously regenerates our genetic structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.96,0:39:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你应该有所体会了吧 - 刚开始体会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You must've noticed the effects by now. - We've just begun to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.76,0:39:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我猜你有七十五岁了 - 不 我十二岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I suppose you're 75. - No, I'm 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.31,0:39:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要等到他成年以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}The metaphasic radiation won't begin to affect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.06,0:39:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,重曲辐射才会对他起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}until he reaches maturity.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.06,0:39:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对大多数人来说 你们拥有的财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}To most off- landers, what you have here is more valuable than.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.44,0:39:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,比黄金更有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}gold- pressed latinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.65,0:39:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕这正是有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid that's the reason that someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.28,0:39:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要夺走你们家园的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}may be trying to take your world away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.95,0:39:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个机器人说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}The artificial life-form was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.29,0:39:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是因为数据 我想你们现在可能已经被人迁走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it were not for Data, it's probable that you would be relocated by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.08,0:39:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么去保护自己？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we possibly defend ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.75,0:39:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦拿起武器 那就跟他们一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moment we pick up a weapon, we become one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.13,0:39:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们就失去了我们本质 - 也许用不着这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We lose everything we are. - It may not come to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.93,0:39:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显阴谋的主使者不希望有人知道这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly, the architects of this conspiracy want to keep it a secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.43,0:39:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅要瞒你们 还得瞒我们那边的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}not only from you, but from my people, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.48,0:40:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让他们得逞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't intend to let them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.91,0:40:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直都知道要想生存 就得与世隔绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've always known that to survive, we had to remain apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.99,0:40:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是这并不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hasn't been easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.83,0:40:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多年轻人对外面的世界充满了好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many of the young people want to know more about the offland.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.25,0:40:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们向往那种快速的生活节奏\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're attracted to stories of a faster pace of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.17,0:40:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这些过惯快节奏生活的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of my people who live that fast a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.84,0:40:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿意不惜一切让节奏慢下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}would sell their souls to slow it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.51,0:40:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.68,0:40:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶尔也会\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are days.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.81,0:40:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟外面世界的其他人不太一样 皮卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't live up to your reputation as an offlander, Picard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.15,0:40:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我得为外面世界说一句 有很多像我这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in defense of offlanders, there are many more people like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.11,0:40:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有机会青春永驻却不心动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wouldn't be tempted by the promise of perpetual youth?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.99,0:40:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.37,0:41:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为你太看得起我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me more credit than I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.71,0:41:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然动心 谁不动心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, of course I'm tempted. Who wouldn't be?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.04,0:41:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是在我那个世界的历史中 有着最黑暗的几个篇章\N{\fnArial\fs30}But some of the darkest chapters in the history of my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.71,0:41:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,某些大集团为了满足私欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}involve the forced relocation of a small group of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.55,0:41:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,而驱逐牺牲一小群人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to satisfy the demands of a large one.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.72,0:41:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我们能从中的到教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hoped that we had learned from our mistakes but.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.19,0:41:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来还是有人没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}it seems that some of us haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.66,0:41:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是手艺精湛呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is extraordinary craftsmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.87,0:41:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是学生们做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the work of students.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.08,0:41:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很快就要成为学徒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're almost ready to become apprentices.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.17,0:41:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,三四十年之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 30 or 40 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.33,0:41:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一部分会成为艺术家\N{\fnArial\fs30}some of them will take their place among the artisans.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.09,0:41:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当学徒要当三十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apprenticing for 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.26,0:42:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就用这办法寻求自律？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did your people's mental discipline develop here?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.76,0:42:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题太多了 真不愧是探索者\N{\fnArial\fs30}More questions. Always the explorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.94,0:42:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你待的够久就会改变的 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you stay long enough, that'll change. - Will it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.61,0:42:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会再去思考昨天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stop reviewing what happened yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.74,0:42:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会再去计划明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}stop planning for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.45,0:42:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问你一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.12,0:42:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有体验过永恒的刹那？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever experienced a perfect moment in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.12,0:42:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,永恒的刹那？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A perfect moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.79,0:42:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间好象停住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When time seemed to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.05,0:42:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,也好像永远都活在那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you could almost live in that moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.47,0:42:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次从太空看见地球的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing my home planet from space for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.93,0:42:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.65,0:42:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么比感知这东西更复杂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing more complicated than perception.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.98,0:42:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们探索宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You explore the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.57,0:43:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我们却发现生命中某一时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've discovered that a single moment in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.74,0:43:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,本身就可以成为宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}can be a universe in itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.16,0:43:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中有无限的活力\N{\fnArial\fs30}full of powerful forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.83,0:43:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人甚至都意识不到现在的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people aren't aware enough of the now to even notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.42,0:43:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望抽出几百年去学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could spare a few centuries to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.01,0:43:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们学习了一百年之后才知道用不着这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took us centuries to learn that it doesn't have to take centuries to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.93,0:43:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一件事 我想不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one thing I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.02,0:43:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,三百年了 你没学过游泳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 300 years, you never learned to swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.82,0:43:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是还没有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just haven't got around to it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.45,0:43:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你是否意识到自己的可靠感 吉恩·卢克·皮卡特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder if you're aware of the trust you engender, Jean-Luc Picard.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.87,0:43:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 根据我的经验 这不大像… - 外来人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In my experience, it's unusual for… - For an offlander?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.13,0:43:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样年轻的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For someone so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.33,0:44:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佐迪？- 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Geordi? - Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.29,0:44:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来不是我的假眼出了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}As it turns out, there wasn't anything wrong with my implants at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.76,0:44:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是我的眼睛开始好转了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was something right with my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.06,0:44:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在赫医生把我的假眼取走之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Dr. Crusher removed the ocular connection,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.48,0:44:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她发现我的视觉神经…\N{\fnArial\fs30}she found that the cells around my optic nerve had…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.69,0:44:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始再生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Started to regenerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.94,0:45:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能不会持久 就算不会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may not last, and if it doesn't, I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.32,0:45:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 我想在我离开之前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted, before we go…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.91,0:45:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我从来没看过日出\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've never seen a sunrise,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.96,0:45:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少看到的不是你们所看到的那种日出\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least, not the way you see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.16,0:45:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.16,0:45:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白你为什么不放了我的人 船长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I to understand that you're not releasing my men, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.38,0:45:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现了全息船\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found the holoship.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.05,0:46:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗阿佛 能不能让我和船长…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ru'afo, why don't you let the Captain and me…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.09,0:46:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.31,0:46:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个任务就因为联邦而一再出错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This entire mission has been one Federation blunder after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.31,0:46:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快放了我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will return my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.44,0:46:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我会终止合作摧毁你的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}or this alliance will end with the destruction of your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.58,0:46:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去很不错 很精神 吉恩·卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking well, Jean-Luc. Rested.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.00,0:46:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你迁走巴库人 我会向联邦议会报告此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let you move them, Admiral. I will take this to the Federation Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.21,0:46:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是按照议会的指示在办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm acting on orders from the Federation Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.59,0:46:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,议会批准你执行违背首要指令的任务？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can there be an order to abandon the Prime Directive?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.47,0:46:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,首要指令并不适用\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Prime Directive doesn't apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.39,0:46:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人并不是巴库星的本地人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are not indigenous to this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.72,0:46:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来就不该长生不老\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were never meant to be immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.35,0:47:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是让他们回复正常的自然进化\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll simply be restoring them to their natural evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.90,0:47:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们凭什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are we.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.06,0:47:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,来决定这些人的下一步进化程序？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to determine the next course of evolution for this people?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.61,0:47:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉恩·卢克 那只有六百个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean-Luc, there are 600 people down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.40,0:47:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以利用这种辐射的再生性\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be able to use the regenerative properties.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.70,0:47:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,造福上亿人\N{\fnArial\fs30}of this radiation to help billions.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.62,0:47:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑那人发明了一种技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Son'a have developed a procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.16,0:47:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以从星球的星环中提取重曲粒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}to collect the metaphasic particles from the planet's rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.54,0:47:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 位于联邦范围的星球 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A planet in Federation space. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.09,0:47:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有星球他们有技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the planet. They have the technology,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.88,0:47:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没法复制的技术 你知道这代表什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}a technology we can't duplicate. You know what that makes us?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.93,0:47:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,合作伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.26,0:47:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种伙伴不亚于低级强盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our partners are nothing more than petty thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.77,0:47:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地球上 石油曾经让低级强盗成为世界领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}On Earth, petroleum once turned petty thugs into world leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.44,0:47:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,曲翘技术使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp drive transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.78,0:47:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗武伦人成立了帝国\N{\fnArial\fs30}a bunch of Romulan thugs into an empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.11,0:47:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能应付桑那人 对此我不担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can handle the Son'a. I'm not worried about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.95,0:47:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,100年前也有人说过罗武伦人算不了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone probably said the same thing about the Romulans a century ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.91,0:47:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,重曲粒子可以延长寿命\N{\fnArial\fs30}With metaphasics, lifespans will be doubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.25,0:48:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种全新的医学将会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}An entire new medical science will evolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.67,0:48:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的首席工程师的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand your chief engineer has the use of his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.17,0:48:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,视觉已经开始恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the first time in his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.59,0:48:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忍心让他得而复失？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you take that away from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.34,0:48:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个荆棘区都是重曲粒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are metaphasic particles all over the Briar Patch.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.72,0:48:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么非要选中这个星球？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does it have to be this one planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.64,0:48:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有星环里的高密度粒子才有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the concentration in the rings that makes the whole damn thing work.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.77,0:48:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别问我 别让我解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ask me to explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.10,0:48:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知他们把什么东西注入星环\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only know they inject something into the rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.06,0:48:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行热解反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}that starts a thermolytic reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.52,0:48:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后星球上将有好几代不能住人\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it's over, the planet will be uninhabitable for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.94,0:48:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 推迟程序 让我们的人研究一下这种技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, delay the procedure. Let my people look at the technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.20,0:48:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最优秀的科学家已研究过了 我们找不到其他办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our best scientific minds already have. We can't find any other way to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.08,0:48:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让桑那人现在巴库星上建一个殖民地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the Son'a can establish a separate colony.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.33,0:48:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们从长计议\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the planet until we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.71,0:48:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要等十年时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would take 10 years of normal exposure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.12,0:48:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的状况才会开始改进\N{\fnArial\fs30}to begin to reverse their condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.29,0:48:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有人活不了那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of them won't survive that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.67,0:48:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 他们不愿意住在荆棘区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, they don't want to live in the middle of the Briar Patch.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.22,0:48:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁愿意？- 巴库人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who would? - The Ba'ku.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.02,0:49:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是这违背了联邦成立时的基本原则\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are betraying the principles upon which the Federation was founded.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.40,0:49:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,使它玷污联邦的精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an attack upon its very soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.83,0:49:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会毁掉巴库文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it will destroy the Ba'ku,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.83,0:49:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我们历史上\N{\fnArial\fs30}just as cultures have been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.67,0:49:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一次强制迁移所摧毁的文明一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}in every other forced relocation throughout history.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.25,0:49:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉恩·卢克 我们只不过是迁走六百个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean-Luc, we're only moving 600 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.76,0:49:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,要祸害多少人 将军 才算是犯错？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people does it take, Admiral, before it becomes wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.35,0:49:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千？五万？一百万？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thousand? Fifty thousand? A million?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.90,0:49:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,要多少人才行 将军？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people does it take, Admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.86,0:49:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令你前往哥伦星系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ordering you to the Goren system.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.40,0:49:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还命令你释放桑那军官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm also ordering the release of the Son'a officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.99,0:49:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么投诉就怎么投诉 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}File whatever protests you wish to, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.41,0:50:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过等你投诉时 我们已经完工了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time you do, this will all be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.18,0:51:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,加利天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gallatin.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.30,0:51:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来 那个顽固的星舰船长终于放了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the righteous Starfleet captain finally released you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.35,0:51:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.77,0:51:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在星球上遇到什么困难了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you encounter any problems on the surface?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.65,0:51:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.86,0:51:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过跟他们相处真不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it wasn't easy being among them.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.19,0:51:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 别忘了他们对我们做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure. Just don't forget what they did to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.24,0:51:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就能把他们搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have them rounded up in a day or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.29,0:51:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再也用不着联邦的全息船了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We needn't bother with a Federation holoship anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.75,0:51:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把关押舱准备好 - 是长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just get the holding cells ready. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.76,0:51:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想念这拉皮技术的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to miss these little flesh-stretching sessions of ours,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.97,0:51:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.91,0:52:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变传送器的线路 这招很聪明 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Re- routing the transport grid to avoid detection was wise, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.62,0:52:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是两点钟之后就很少有人使用传送器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, the transporter is rarely used after 0200 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.25,0:52:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备坐船长游艇出去兜风？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking the Captain's yacht out for a spin?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.59,0:52:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,七公吨极元炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven metric tons of ultritium explosives,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.13,0:52:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,八挺脉冲枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}eight tetryon pulse launchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.71,0:52:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,十支同位磁解枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and 10 isomagnetic disintegrators.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.84,0:52:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像是要去去打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you're planning on doing some hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.64,0:52:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都回自己的岗位去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to your quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.47,0:52:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是命令 - 你没穿制服 没权下令\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's an order. - No uniform, no orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.19,0:52:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 知道他们的处境后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, how could I look at another sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.27,0:52:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么还能心安理得的看日出呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing what my sight cost these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.32,0:52:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在有必要指出 这种环境异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel obliged to point out that the environmental anomalies.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.24,0:52:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会导致莫中年轻人所特有的反叛性\N{\fnArial\fs30}may have stimulated certain rebellious instincts common to youth,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.91,0:52:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会影响所有人的判断力\N{\fnArial\fs30}which could affect everyone's judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.66,0:52:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我是例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except mine, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.95,0:52:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 数据 你说说我们应该怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Data, what do you think we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.96,0:52:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸣金击鼓 准备战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saddle up. Lock and load.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.42,0:53:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要星球上还住着人 他们就不会动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't begin the procedure while the planet is still inhabited,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.47,0:53:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的任务就是要尽量把人留在星球上\N{\fnArial\fs30}so our job is to keep the planet inhabited.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.76,0:53:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦 佐迪 你们把飞船开除荆棘区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will, Geordi, go back and put a face on what's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.10,0:53:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把巴库人的情况报告给议会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the Council see the Ba'ku.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.94,0:53:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们对自己不知道的人所遭受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too easy to turn a blind eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.81,0:53:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛苦总是容易视而不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the suffering of a people you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.61,0:53:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会快去快回的 - 我们会尽量撑久一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be back before you know it. - We'll hold out as long as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.97,0:53:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在模拟操作时 注入器表现极佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}The injector performs perfectly in every simulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.72,0:53:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 企业号已经离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, as the Enterprise left orbit,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.23,0:53:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有一艘小艇降落到星球上\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of their support craft went down to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.31,0:53:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.65,0:54:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去是船长游艇 艇上有五个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appeared to be the Captain's yacht. Five persons onboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.15,0:54:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能再等到早上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not waiting until morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.15,0:54:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚就把那些人全都传送上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the shuttles and get everyone off the surface tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.32,0:54:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,加利天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gallatin.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.83,0:54:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果皮卡特和他的人插手 就干掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Picard or any of his people interfere, eliminate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.00,0:54:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要暂时离开村子 只带上必需品\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're leaving the village! Take only what you need!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.26,0:54:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上粮食 可能得过几天我们才能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring food! We may not be back for days!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.19,0:54:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是反传送器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a transport inhibitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.57,0:54:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了它太空船就没法把人从地面上传送走\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will help prevent spaceships from beaming anyone off the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.57,0:54:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,山脉上这些凯波岩\N{\fnArial\fs30}These veins of kelbonite running through the hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.74,0:54:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以干扰到他们的传送器\N{\fnArial\fs30}will interfere with their transporters,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.79,0:54:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到了没有凯波岩的山路上时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when the terrain forces us away from the deposits,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.71,0:55:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会用反传送器来阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we'll use transport inhibitors as a compensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.88,0:55:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,山里面有很密集的凯波岩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mountains have the heaviest concentration of kelbonite.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.80,0:55:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了那儿 传送器就会完全失效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once there, it'll make transport virtually impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.55,0:55:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,山里面有个山洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are caves in those mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.88,0:55:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 到了那儿我们就可以撑上好几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we should be able to hold out for a long time once we're there,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.89,0:55:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他们不会轻易让我们到那儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they're not gonna make it easy for us to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.10,0:55:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.56,0:55:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经启动了村子周围的反传送器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've activated the transport inhibitors around the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.31,0:55:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.57,0:55:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快带大家离开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move these people out!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.78,0:55:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,传送器全部失灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transporters are not functioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.91,0:55:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用反传送器挡住了电波\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're blocking the beams with some kind of inhibitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.29,0:55:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得先找到并摧毁它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to locate and destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.43,0:55:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 儿子 你拿的东西太多了 我们得爬好长的山路呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Son, you're carrying too much. We have a long climb ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.40,0:56:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们损失了三架反传送器 有段路出现了空隙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost three transport inhibitors. There's a gap in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.56,0:56:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿添！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artim!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.19,0:56:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.04,0:57:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们沿着矿脉行走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're following the kelbonite deposits,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.00,0:57:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用干扰物来对抗传送器\N{\fnArial\fs30}using the interference to block our transporters.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.46,0:57:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么建议？- 让我下去 我要去跟皮卡特谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Recommendations? - Take me down. Let me talk to Picard.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.88,0:57:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈谈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.46,0:57:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该派人下去把他们强制带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should send down an assault team and take them by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.05,0:57:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种做法不能接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not an acceptable option.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.80,0:57:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人受伤 那么联邦所给予的支持…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If people get hurt, all the support we have in the Federation…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.68,0:57:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Federation support,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.35,0:57:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦的程序 联邦的规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Federation procedures, Federation rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.60,0:57:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看镜子 上将 联邦已经老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look in the mirror, Admiral. The Federation is old.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.94,0:57:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在过去的两年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the past 24 months,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.69,0:57:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦受到各大力量的挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}they've been challenged by every major power in the quadrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.32,0:57:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,博格 卡塔锡安还有自治领\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Borg, the Cardassians, the Dominion,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.32,0:57:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,都闻到了联邦衰败的气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}they all smell the scent of death on the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.16,0:57:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们才跟我们合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you've embraced our offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.25,0:57:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这会让联邦拥有新生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it will give your dear Federation new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.12,0:57:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是多么渴望新生命啊 将军？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how badly do you want it, Admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.21,0:57:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你现在必须做出艰难的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because there are hard choices to be made now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.05,0:57:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果让企业号联络上议会\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Enterprise gets through with news.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.09,0:57:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道他们那勇敢的船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}about their brave Captain's valiant struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.72,0:58:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,见义勇为的扶助弱小的巴库人 那联邦政治家可能就会动摇\N{\fnArial\fs30}on behalf of the defenseless Ba'ku, your Federation politicians will waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.43,0:58:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的联邦民意调查将会激起民愤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Federation opinion polls will open a public debate.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.56,0:58:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的联邦盟友也要讨个说法 还要我说下去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Federation allies will want their say. Need I go on?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.90,0:58:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了全面进攻 还有个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an alternative to an all- out assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.57,0:58:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,出动辅运蜂 把他们一个个传送上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isolinear tags would allow our transporters to lock onto them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.45,0:58:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那得一个一个锁定 太浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd have to tag every one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.86,0:58:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们耗不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would take time, and we don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.49,0:58:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过19个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Enterprise is only 19 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.74,0:58:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业号就能联邦取得联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}from communications range with the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.04,0:58:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会命令瑞克调头回来 - 你是说皮卡特的大副\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll order Riker to turn around. - Picard's first officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.21,0:58:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为他会听你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really believe he'll listen?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.05,0:58:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的飞船可以在企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ships are capable of intercepting the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.05,0:58:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞离荆棘区之前拦住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}before it reaches the perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.22,0:58:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以派船去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could send them to…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.43,0:58:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,去押送它回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}To escort it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.98,0:58:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但瑞克中校未必肯回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Commander Riker might not want to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.82,0:58:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,派出你的飞船吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send your ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.97,0:59:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢做机器人吗？- 我努力想要超越自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you like being a machine? - I aspire to be more than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.14,0:59:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道原因 这样我们就不会再害怕你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know why. So people like us won't be afraid of you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.44,0:59:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.52,0:59:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来都不累吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you ever get tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.52,0:59:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不累 我的电池自动的持续充电\N{\fnArial\fs30}My power cells continually recharge themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.57,0:59:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想象不出做机器人是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't imagine what it's like to be a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.29,0:59:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来你可能会惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps it would surprise you to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.62,0:59:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也经常想象着做孩子是什么样的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I have often tried to imagine what it is like to be a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.79,0:59:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.00,0:59:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一条就是孩子们的腿会比较短\N{\fnArial\fs30}For one thing, your legs are shorter than everyone else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.92,0:59:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们会不停的生长\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they are in a constant state of growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.97,1:00:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有没有觉得难以适应呢？- 适应？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you find it difficult to adapt? - Adapt?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.89,1:00:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们的骨骼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A child's specifications are never the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.10,1:00:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一秒钟都在发生变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}from one moment to the next.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.47,1:00:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可奇怪的是 你不会被自己绊倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a wonder you do not trip over your own feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.44,1:00:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时侯会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.52,1:00:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的腿长永远是87.2厘米 那是设计好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My legs are exactly 87.2 centimeters in length.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.61,1:00:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我刚出厂的时候它们就是87.2厘米\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were 87.2 centimeters the day I was created.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.20,1:00:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想等我报废的那天它们还会是87.2厘米\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will be 87.2 centimeters the day I go off-line.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.57,1:00:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为只有规格不变 我才能够正常的运行\N{\fnArial\fs30}My operation depends on specifications that do not change.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.04,1:00:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远都不会知道成长的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never know the experience of growing up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.50,1:00:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有被自己绊倒过\N{\fnArial\fs30}or tripping over my own feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.88,1:00:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不会有大人整天对你啰啰嗦嗦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've never had adults telling you what to do all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.76,1:00:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要你早睡 要你吃你不想吃的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}or bedtimes or having to eat food you don't like.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.51,1:00:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是很愿意用按时上床睡觉来交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would gladly accept the requirement of a bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.01,1:00:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来体验一下做孩子的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}in exchange for knowing what it is like to be a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.64,1:00:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 机器人玩耍吗？- 是的 我会拉小提琴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do machines ever play? - Yes. I play the violin,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.94,1:00:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我的棋艺也相当不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my chess routines are quite advanced.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.86,1:00:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说 你有没有开心的玩耍过？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean, haven't you ever just played for fun?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.45,1:01:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是机器人不知道开心这回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Androids do not have fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.95,1:01:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 要想知道做孩子是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you wanna know what it's like to be a child,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.37,1:01:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就得学会玩耍\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need to learn to play.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.18,1:01:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.55,1:01:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡夫先生 你该理发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Worf, you need a haircut.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.43,1:01:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林冈人在扎塔拉期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accelerated hair growth is often experienced by Klingons.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.06,1:01:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,头发总是长的很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}during jak'tahla.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.81,1:01:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 扎塔拉期？- 翻译过来 就是青春期\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jak'tahla? - Roughly translated, puberty,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.19,1:01:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然对克林冈人来说并不太准确\N{\fnArial\fs30}although for a Klingon, that scarcely does it justice.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.44,1:01:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一有情绪波动或是有暴力倾向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any severe mood swings, unusual aggressive tendencies,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.99,1:01:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上就通知我 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you let me know at once. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.87,1:01:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴库人该休息了 根据地理扫描\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ba'ku need some rest, sir. According to the geo-scan,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.24,1:01:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,几公里内这里比较安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is the safest area within the next few kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.37,1:01:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 休息一小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well. We'll take an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.50,1:01:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 分配一下食物 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have them break out some rations. - Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.63,1:02:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,山脊的背面就是山洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right beyond that ridge is where the caves begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.01,1:02:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面可以躲上几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can hide there for days.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.76,1:02:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑那人肯定已经扫描过这一带的地形\N{\fnArial\fs30}By now, the Son'a will have scanned this area.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.84,1:02:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们和我们一样清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll know that as well as we do.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.27,1:02:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,三百年来我第一次见到秃头的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been 300 years since I've seen a bald man.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.32,1:02:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么一直都没结婚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it that you never married?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.15,1:02:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我你是因为还没来得及\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't tell me it's just because you haven't got around to it yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.20,1:02:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什要急呢？- 我得警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the rush? - I should warn you,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.29,1:02:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是很吸引成熟女性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always been attracted to older women.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.61,1:03:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么做到的？- 干嘛问那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are you doing this? - No more questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.04,1:03:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,中校 侦测到两艘桑那船只想要拦截我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander, I'm showing two Son'a ships on an intercept course.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.21,1:03:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么时候追到？- 十八分钟后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long till they reach us? - Eighteen minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.01,1:03:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们至少一小时后离开荆棘区进行通讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't be able to get a transmission out of here for at least another hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.93,1:03:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们再呼叫我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're hailing us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.34,1:03:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们 我们的通讯系统失灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them our transceiver assembly is down,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.26,1:03:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能发送 不能接收\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we can send messages but not receive them.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.68,1:03:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得他们不会相信 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think they believe us. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.52,1:03:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,光子鱼雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Photon torpedo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.23,1:03:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,通讯失灵就用这么打招呼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that the universal greeting when communications are down?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.32,1:03:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般对不喜欢的人才会这么打招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's the universal greeting when you don't like someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.82,1:03:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,全速前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full impulse.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.20,1:03:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞船在荆棘区经不起全速前进 中校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manifolds can't handle full impulse in the Patch, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.07,1:03:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们快不过他们 飞船上所有的人都会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't outrun them, the manifolds'll be the only thing left on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.83,1:03:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去工程室 - 红色警报！全体人员 准备作战！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be in Engineering. - Red alert! All hands, battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.00,1:04:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有觉得你的胸部变得结实了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And have you noticed how your boobs have started to firm up?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.54,1:04:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年代 大家都不重视这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that we care about such things in this day and age.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.97,1:04:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Data.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.94,1:04:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在真的很想尝尝动物的鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've an odd craving for the blood of a live Kolar beast.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.94,1:04:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定又是环境造成的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}This environment must be affecting me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.61,1:04:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有觉得你的胸部开始变得结实呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And have you noticed how your boobs have started to firm up?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.36,1:04:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这个年代 实在是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that we care about…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.28,1:04:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快隐蔽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.16,1:05:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是辅运蜂 可以跟踪传送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isolinear tags. The transporters can lock onto them.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.67,1:05:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找地方躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to find shelter.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.29,1:05:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个山脚那有个山洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a cavern at the base of the next hill.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.88,1:05:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.25,1:06:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 护盾功能只剩60%了 - 这是工程室呼叫舰桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shields at 60%. - Engineering to Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.88,1:06:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,重氢快要着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're burning deuterium down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.04,1:06:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,用不着桑那人动手 我们也会自行爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna blow ourselves up. We won't need any help from the Son'a!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.63,1:06:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那团星云里面是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's inside that nebula cluster?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.30,1:06:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,慧星碎块 大团不稳定的易燃气体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cometary debris, pockets of unstable metreon gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.72,1:06:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能进去 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to go in there, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.89,1:06:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 要进去 我来操作 少尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we do. I'll take it from here, Ensign.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.35,1:06:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来现在我们只能以险取胜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to use the Briar Patch the way Brer Rabbit did.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.95,1:06:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家进洞里去 快点儿！所有人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside the caves, quickly! Everyone! This way!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.46,1:06:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.01,1:07:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我真的很想打一架 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely feeling aggressive tendencies, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.52,1:07:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发射了同位线炸弹 一股空间裂缝正在形成\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've detonated an isolytic burst. A subspace tear is forming.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.48,1:07:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,荧幕显像\N{\fnArial\fs30}On screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.15,1:07:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇托姆协议不是禁止使用次空间武器吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought subspace weapons were banned by the Khitomer Accord.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.07,1:07:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得提醒我提出抗议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind me to lodge a protest.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.61,1:07:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的曲翘核心会吸引裂缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our warp core is acting like a magnet to the tear.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.78,1:07:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像沿着太空拉开拉链\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're pulling it like a zipper across space.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.12,1:07:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么办法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Options?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.29,1:07:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以扔掉核心 - 这会停止裂缝吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We could eject the core. - Will that stop the tear?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.17,1:07:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问倒我了中校\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.04,1:07:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的专业建议？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your expert opinion?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.75,1:07:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆曲翘核心可能会停止裂缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detonating the warp core might neutralize the cascade.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.38,1:07:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then again, it might not.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.22,1:07:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,次空间武器是难以预测的 所以才会被禁用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subspace weapons are unpredictable. That's why they were banned.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.05,1:07:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,裂缝正在向我们靠近\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tear is closing on us.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.31,1:07:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 十五秒以后到达 - 扔出核心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Impact in 15 seconds. - Eject the core.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.73,1:07:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经扔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just did.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.90,1:07:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,十秒后到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impact in 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.11,1:07:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detonate!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.92,1:08:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫医务人员过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me a medic over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.39,1:08:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了 中校 裂缝被封住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It worked, Commander. The tear has been sealed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.77,1:08:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 可他们还会再来一次的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but there's nothing to stop them from doing it again,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.48,1:08:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时后我们就没有核心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're fresh out of warp cores.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.69,1:08:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们距离通讯范围还有36分钟 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still 36 minutes from transmission range, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.61,1:08:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们得躲着点这些混蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're through running from these bastards.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.25,1:09:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有43人被抓走了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another 43 reported taken, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.31,1:09:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 他们想把我们逼出去 然后再用辅运蜂锁定我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, they're trying to drive us out so their drones can tag us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.61,1:09:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据地下热水口的资料分析\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all the hydrothermal vents in the substrata,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.82,1:09:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这个山洞的结构不会支持的太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}the structural integrity of this cavern is not going to hold for long.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.82,1:09:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有其他出口吗？- 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there another way out of here? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.86,1:09:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 跟着水源 也许能找到出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, tracking the water's course may reveal another exit.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.95,1:09:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡夫 跟我们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Worf, come with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.00,1:09:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我探测到这块方解石壁后面有氮氧气流 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm reading a nitrogen- oxygen flow behind that calcite formation, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.92,1:09:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果炸掉它山洞能不能撑得住？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will this structure hold if we were to blast through?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.80,1:09:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想可以的长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe it is safe, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.81,1:09:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.87,1:10:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫大家到这边洞里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get everybody into those caves,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.71,1:10:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家一进去就设置力场\N{\fnArial\fs30}and set up force fields once they're inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.12,1:10:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.55,1:10:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐迪 那些是易燃气团吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geordi, are those pockets of metreon gas?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.76,1:10:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 中校 具有爆炸性 我建议我们保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Commander. Highly volatile. I'd recommend we keep our distance.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.14,1:10:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要让储存勺大量收集这些气团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative. I want to use the ramscoop to collect as much of it as we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.77,1:10:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么目的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The purpose being?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.10,1:10:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的目的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The purpose being,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.19,1:10:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,要把它塞进桑那人的喉咙里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend to shove it down the Son'a's throat.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.02,1:10:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,中校 但如果他们的武器击中那些气团的话 那我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander, if one of their weapons hits that gas…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.40,1:10:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们唯一的出路 丹尼尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our only way out of here, Mr. Daniels.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.86,1:10:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这以后可能会被人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be surprised if history remembers this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.36,1:10:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,称为瑞克战术\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the Riker Maneuver.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.62,1:10:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果成功的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it works.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.54,1:10:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑 进入人工驾驶模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer, access manual steering column.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.12,1:11:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入人工驾驶模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transfer helm controls to manual.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.54,1:11:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰桥 已到达最大储存容量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridge, storage cells are at maximum capacity.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.46,1:11:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在启动武器部署 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're powering their forward weapons array, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.84,1:11:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆储存勺 准备 全速推进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blow out the ramscoop. Stand by. Full thrusters.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.09,1:11:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,储存勺发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramscoop released.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.53,1:11:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.24,1:11:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据 蔡 快带他们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data, Troi, keep these people moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.79,1:11:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring them out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.30,1:11:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜辅运蜂过不了多久就会过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suspect it won't be long before the drones get here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.72,1:11:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving! Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.01,1:11:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面有山洞 那儿会安全一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found caves on higher ground. We'll be safe there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.02,1:12:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 快过来看看这个 他的DNA分析\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, take a look at this med- scan, his DNA profile.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.70,1:12:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这怎么可能？- 应该问问他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How can that be possible? - Maybe we should ask them.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.42,1:12:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿添 你在干什么？快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artim, what are you doing? Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.10,1:12:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是最后一组吗？- 是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this the last group? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.69,1:12:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他们准备出去 我们得赶快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them ready to move out. We need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.86,1:12:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮找阿添去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anij went to find Artim.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.39,1:13:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟图奈尔走！- 不 我要跟你在一起！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go with Tournel! - No, I wanna stay with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.06,1:13:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边更安全 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is safer there. Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.65,1:13:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫皮卡特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worf to Picard!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.95,1:13:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人生命迹象 其中一个生命垂危\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two life- signs, one of them extremely faint.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.99,1:13:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有将近4吨的石头 拦住了我们的去路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are almost 4 metric tons of rock blocking our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.45,1:13:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那会震塌别的山洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That might cause another cave-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.44,1:14:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anij?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.69,1:14:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anij?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.53,1:14:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胡夫呼叫皮卡特 - 胡夫？我听得到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Worf to Picard. - Worf? Yes, I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.86,1:14:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们设法救你们出来 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are trying to get to you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.54,1:14:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anij.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.34,1:14:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,救援马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help is on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.88,1:14:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胡夫 快点 安妮受了伤 - 有多严重 船长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Worf, hurry. Anij is hurt. - How bad is she, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.68,1:14:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她快不行了 - 我们尽快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm losing her. - We're coming as fast as we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.74,1:14:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮 别离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anij, stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.08,1:15:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我力量 让我留住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me find the power to keep you in this moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.08,1:15:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.42,1:15:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要放弃这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let go of this moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.85,1:15:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况很稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's stabilizing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.52,1:15:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搬动她安全吗？- 比留在这安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it safe to move her? - Safer than leaving her here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.95,1:15:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还以为要几百年才能学会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you thought it would take centuries to learn.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.55,1:17:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他们投降 我就不把你告上军事法庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order them to surrender and I promise you won't be court-martialed.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.63,1:17:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果只有上军事法庭才能让联邦知道这件事的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a court- martial is the only way to let the people of the Federation know.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.30,1:17:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我乐意至极\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is happening here, I welcome it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.01,1:17:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业号摧毁了我一艘战船\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Enterprise has destroyed one of my ships!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.06,1:17:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一艘也起火求救\N{\fnArial\fs30}The other is on fire, requesting assistance.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.98,1:17:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业号只会自卫还击\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Enterprise would only fire to defend itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.81,1:17:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗阿佛一定曾下令攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ru'afo must have ordered the attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.36,1:17:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他事先\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe he would have given that order.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.40,1:17:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定征得了你的同意 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}without your consent, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.86,1:17:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想我们俩谁会上军事法庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder which of us will be facing that court-martial.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.08,1:17:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样下去不会再有什么好处了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing further to be gained from this.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.08,1:17:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得对 现在一切就要结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. This is going to end now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.67,1:17:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴库人非要留下来 请便\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ba'ku want to stay on the planet. Let them.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.08,1:17:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我照样发射注入器 - 你不能这么做…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going to launch the injector. - You're not going to launch anything…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.92,1:18:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,六小时后 这星系的一切生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}In six hours, every living thing in this system.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.59,1:18:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会死亡或者重伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be dead or dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.93,1:18:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忍心杀死自己的同胞 罗阿佛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would kill your own people, Ru'afo?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.55,1:18:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己的父母？兄弟姐妹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your own parents, brothers, sisters?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.10,1:18:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 你难道不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you know, Admiral?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.52,1:18:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,桑那和巴库是同一种族\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Son'a and the Ba'ku are the same race.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.78,1:18:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮卡特刚刚告诉了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picard just told us.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.03,1:18:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的DNA是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our DNA is identical.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.20,1:18:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是哪个？加纳？罗佛尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one were you? Gal'na? Ro'tin?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.96,1:18:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些名字 那些孩子已经永远消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those names, those children are gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.42,1:18:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.25,1:18:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一百年前 有一群年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A century ago, a group of our young people.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.42,1:18:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要追随外面的生活方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}wanted to follow the ways of the offlanders.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.63,1:18:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要企图夺权 但终于失败…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tried to take over the colony, and when they failed…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.39,1:18:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我们驱逐 任由我们自生自灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we failed, you exiled us to die slowly.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.56,1:18:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你是罗佛尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Ro'tin, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.06,1:18:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,从声音我听得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something in the voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.90,1:19:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他的朋友加纳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you be his friend, Gal'na?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.32,1:19:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你小时候我帮你母亲给你洗过澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I helped your mother bathe you when you were a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.91,1:19:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她仍然经常会谈起你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She still speaks of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.28,1:19:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你令联邦介入了一场家族仇恨 将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've brought the Federation into the middle of a blood feud, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.95,1:19:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们回来驱逐上一代\N{\fnArial\fs30}The children have returned to expel their elders,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.67,1:19:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,只因为他们曾被驱逐\N{\fnArial\fs30}just as they were once expelled,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.00,1:19:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过罗阿佛的报复已经升级为赶尽杀绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}except that Ru'afo's need for revenge has now escalated into parricide.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.18,1:19:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这样做都是为了联邦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was for the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.85,1:19:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都是为了联邦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was all for the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.15,1:19:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赶快离开这里吧 任务结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking this ship out of here. This mission is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.70,1:19:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还没有结束 - 我说结束了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is not over. - It is over!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.21,1:20:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么资格来命令我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not take orders from you!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.48,1:20:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不顾居民的死活 发射注入器\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you launch the injector while the planet's still populated,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.69,1:20:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦绝不会放过你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Federation will pursue you until…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.69,1:20:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦永远也不会知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Federation will never know what happened here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.43,1:21:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,多尔蒂将军不过来和我们一起吃晚饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Dougherty will not be joining us for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.44,1:21:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动收集站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deploy the collector.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.11,1:21:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你对我的命令有意见吗？- 可以单独谈谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have a problem with that order? - May I talk to you alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.28,1:21:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 启动收集站 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Deploy the collector. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.70,1:21:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,迁走他们就行了 何必赶尽杀绝…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving them is one thing. Killing them all…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.62,1:21:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人比你更恨他们了 加纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one hated them more than you, Gal'na.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.58,1:21:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好不容易才走到了今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've come a long way together.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.13,1:21:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们计划了这么多年 就是为了这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the moment we've planned for so many years.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.39,1:21:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,把星际舰队的人带走 关到舰尾的货舱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Separate the Starfleet personnel and secure them in the aft cargo hold.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.47,1:21:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得把皮卡特也关进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that Picard joins them.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.27,1:21:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行热解反应时\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shields in that section.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.40,1:21:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰尾的货物无法抵抗热辐射\N{\fnArial\fs30}won't protect them against the thermolytic reaction.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.32,1:21:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你提醒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for reminding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.86,1:22:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉恩·卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jean-Luc.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.88,1:22:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.89,1:23:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做人质的时候 肯定感觉怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must have been strange for you when you were a hostage,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.19,1:23:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,周围全是多年前所熟悉的朋友和家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}surrounded by all the friends and family you knew all those years ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.86,1:23:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都和以前一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}each one looking exactly as they did then.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.15,1:23:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像 在用孩童的眼睛看着他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like looking through the eyes of childhood again.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.99,1:23:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你现在闭上了这双眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here you are, closing those eyes,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.50,1:23:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着不去看仇恨给桑那人造成的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying not to see what bitterness has done to the Son'a,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.67,1:23:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它把罗佛尔变成一了个疯子同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}how it's turned Ru'afo into a madman.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.00,1:23:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你变成一了个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, turned you into a coward,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.09,1:23:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个泯灭良心的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}a man who denies his own conscience.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.76,1:23:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.44,1:23:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个毫无道德 无视暴行的懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}A coward without the moral courage to prevent an atrocity.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.28,1:23:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我恶心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You offend me!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.78,1:24:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是联邦军官的求饶方法吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this how a Federation officer pleads for his life?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.70,1:24:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在为自己求饶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not pleading for my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.79,1:24:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在为你求饶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pleading for yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.71,1:24:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还可以回头 加纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can still go home, Gal'na.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.47,1:24:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑 关上电梯门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer, close turbolift doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.48,1:24:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我做的事是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're asking me to do is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.15,1:24:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道怎么阻止注入器吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how to disable the injector?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.15,1:24:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,得到舰桥上才能操作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would need to be on the Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.23,1:24:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,船员都是罗佛尔的心腹 武力没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crew is loyal to Ru'afo. An assault would fail.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.82,1:24:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们可以调虎离山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we can lure him away.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.91,1:24:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪并不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.16,1:24:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他意识到什么不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as he realizes something's happening,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.33,1:24:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他通过联络器就可以废掉我的指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll override my commands with one word to his comm link.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.66,1:24:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不让他意识不到不对劲…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he doesn't realize something's happening…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.17,1:24:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给我个传送器吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you get me to a transmitter?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.84,1:24:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要联络地面上的数据和胡夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to speak with Data and Worf down on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.50,1:24:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll need their help.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.34,1:25:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,12层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deck 12.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.14,1:25:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动分离协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initiate separation protocols.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.18,1:25:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动注入器舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activating injector assembly.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.47,1:25:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,3分钟后进行分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Separation in three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.02,1:25:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,星球上飞来一艘小飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}A small craft is coming up from the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.98,1:25:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,它正在部署武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's powering up its weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.15,1:25:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打开屏幕 - 船上只有一个人 那个机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On screen. - One person aboard. It's the android.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.53,1:25:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他无关紧要\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's no threat.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.70,1:25:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 数据呼叫皮卡特 - 说吧 数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Data to Picard. - Go ahead, Data.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.12,1:25:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎样攻击 他们都不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, they're ignoring my attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.12,1:25:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续朝护盾发射光速粒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep firing tachyon bursts into the shield grid.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.96,1:25:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胡夫准备好没有？- 是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is Worf in position? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.54,1:25:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经准备好了同步传送\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is ready for simultaneous transport.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.84,1:25:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在接近舰桥 通讯完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're approaching the Bridge. Picard out.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.80,1:25:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钟后进行分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Separation in one minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.05,1:25:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 那首联邦飞船正在攻击我们的护盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, the Federation ship is creating a disruption in our shield.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.06,1:25:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果护盾失灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they go out of phase,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.23,1:25:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就没法遮挡热解反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll increase our exposure to the thermolytic reaction.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.90,1:25:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 摧毁那艘船 重新设置护盾调波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well. Destroy that ship. Reset our shield harmonics.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.07,1:26:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要延误倒计时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not delay the countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.66,1:26:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据呼叫皮卡特 他们在切换护盾调波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data to Picard. They are rotating their shield harmonics.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.33,1:26:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要返回地面了 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am attempting to return to the surface, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.37,1:26:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的联邦飞船被打跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Federation ship has been disabled.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.25,1:26:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十秒后进行分离放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Separation in 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.67,1:26:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？- 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.26,1:26:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 系统没有受到影响 - 十秒后进行分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The systems don't seem affected. - Separation in 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.93,1:26:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数五秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.60,1:26:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,注入器舱已经分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Injector assembly has separated.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.46,1:26:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟模拟情况一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly as the simulations predicted.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.26,1:27:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,重曲辐射量没有任何变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not showing any change in metaphasic flux levels.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.39,1:27:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫描器肯定出问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your scanners must be malfunctioning.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.31,1:27:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,船上所有功能都失灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All ship functions are off- line.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.43,1:27:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果屏幕还好端端的 别的怎么可能会失灵呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can there be no ship functions if the viewscreen is working?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.65,1:27:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,人造重力很稳定 救生能源…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artificial gravity is stable. Life support is…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.00,1:27:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,全息飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}A holodeck.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.20,1:28:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们调整护盾的时侯 被传送到全息飞船上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were transported to the holoship when we reset our shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.53,1:28:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所看到的全都是假象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we saw was an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.50,1:28:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗阿佛授权△21\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ru'afo, authorization Delta 2-1.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.37,1:28:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,取消所有注入器的指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Override all interlinked commands to injector assembly one.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.84,1:28:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unable to comply.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.55,1:28:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一号注射器舱已经被终止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Injector assembly one has been deactivated.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.89,1:28:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,收集站上所有的注入器子系统都已经确认关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}All injector subsystems aboard the collector are confirmed off-line.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.23,1:28:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,解除全息船护盾 启动牵引光束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decloak the holoship and engage a tractor beam.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.40,1:28:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.58,1:28:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,船员知道不对劲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crew knows something's happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.66,1:29:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经封住了舰桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've secured the Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.04,1:29:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘船上有十四个远程传送器\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ship is equipped with 14 long-range transporters.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.67,1:29:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部失灵了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they all useless?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.26,1:29:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被传送来以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must have been locked and secured.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.72,1:29:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们肯定被锁定住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}after we were beamed here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.34,1:29:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isolate one.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.59,1:29:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把命令程序转接到备用处理器上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and re- route its command sequence through the auxiliary processor.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.43,1:29:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕没什么用 他们已经控制了我们的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, there's nothing we can do. They already have control of our ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.44,1:29:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没打算回到我们的船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't plan on going back to our ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.90,1:29:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胡夫 摧毁那东西 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Worf, destroy that thing. - Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.53,1:29:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器系统全都失灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons systems have been taken off-line.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.74,1:29:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,船员们更改了舰桥控制权\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crew is re- routing Bridge controls.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.08,1:29:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 收集站上有麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, there is a problem aboard the collector.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.79,1:29:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动程序被恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The launch sequence has resumed.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.13,1:29:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,偏正翼护盾被打开了 有人上去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Collector shields have been raised. Someone's onboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.59,1:29:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是罗阿佛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Ru'afo.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.96,1:29:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这儿能控制发射程序吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you override the launch sequence from here?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.80,1:29:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,得有他的访问密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not without his access codes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.30,1:29:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有自毁程序吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a self-destruct?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.09,1:29:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 但没有密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but without the codes, it would have to be activated.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.93,1:30:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就只能在收集器的上部控制矩阵启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the upper control matrix on the collector.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.22,1:30:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡夫 想办法把我传送下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Worf, try and find some way to beam through those shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.48,1:30:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有手动引爆 仅有两秒钟的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd have to detonate it manually. There'd only be a two-second delay.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.31,1:30:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有在离收集站一百米以内\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may be able to transport between the shield generators.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.44,1:30:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,才可以把你传送过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we are within 100 meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.49,1:30:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把船靠过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us into position.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.82,1:30:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,守住岗位 中校 你得再把我传送回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remain at your post, Commander. I'll need you to beam me back.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.66,1:30:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在靠近收集站\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're approaching the collector.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.99,1:30:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,分离前一分钟 制冷缸会开始排气\N{\fnArial\fs30}One minute before separation, you'll see the cryogenic tanks venting.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.25,1:30:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果开枪就可能引爆废气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons fire could ignite the exhaust.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.84,1:30:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,两分十五秒后进行分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Separation in 2 minutes and 15 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.02,1:30:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人闯入 有人闯入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intruder alert. Intruder alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.64,1:31:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.40,1:31:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡夫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worf?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.74,1:31:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,收集站上有皮卡特船长的生命迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm picking up Captain Picard's bio-signature onboard the collector.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.24,1:31:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 企业号呼叫皮卡特！- 大副\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Enterprise to Picard! - Number One.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.24,1:31:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在接近你的位置 需要援助吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're approaching your position. Do you need assistance?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.58,1:31:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概一分钟后把我带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may need a lift in a minute or so.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.75,1:31:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.42,1:31:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钟后进行分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Separation in one minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.45,1:32:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 报告情况 - 是罗阿佛的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Report. - It's Ru'afo's ship!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.12,1:32:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}On screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.04,1:32:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,传感器显示 船上有一百名巴库人和一个克林冈人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sensors are reading over 100 Ba'ku onboard and one Klingon.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.79,1:32:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁定他们的腹部引擎和救生能源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target their ventral engines and life support.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.96,1:32:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定撞击路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set a collision course.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.80,1:32:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.31,1:32:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗阿佛 我们太老了 别打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ru'afo, we're getting too old for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.43,1:32:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了今天 对于我们两个来说 这就不再是问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After today, that won't be a problem for either of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.98,1:32:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十秒后进行分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Separation in 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.11,1:32:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不怕会点燃废气？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really going to risk igniting the exhaust?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.74,1:33:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我不怕！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I will!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.17,1:33:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 护盾只剩60%了 - 保持航线\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shields at 60%. - Hold your course.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.01,1:33:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他不会的 - 不 他会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He wouldn't. - Yes, he would.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.51,1:33:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.36,1:33:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好船长 我们快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by, Captain. We're right around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.53,1:33:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, time's up.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.03,1:34:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么耽搁了 大副？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kept you, Number One?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.74,1:34:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦议会让我通知你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Federation Council has asked me to inform you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.53,1:34:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,先中止巴库人的迁移 他们要认进行高层评估\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the Ba'ku relocation will be halted while they conduct a top-level review.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.33,1:34:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 罗阿佛的飞船在呼叫我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, Ru'afo's ship is hailing us.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.21,1:34:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打开屏幕 - 打开屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On screen. - On screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.67,1:34:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 桑那船员想跟我们停火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, the Son'a crew would like to negotiate a cease-fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.09,1:34:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是因为我们这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may have something to do with the fact.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.76,1:34:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下了三分钟的空气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we have three minutes of air left.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.47,1:34:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业号上有的是空气 胡夫 准备传送\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have plenty over here, Mr. Worf. Prepare to beam aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.52,1:34:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们远离了重曲辐射\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think when we get away from this metaphasic radiation,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.19,1:34:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的感情会变淡吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll change the way we feel?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.77,1:35:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我遇到你的那天起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your feelings about her have not changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.44,1:35:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对她的感情始终如一\N{\fnArial\fs30}since the day I met you, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.03,1:35:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方只是让你表现了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place just let them out for a little fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.12,1:35:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能有办法让他们回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish there were a way to bring them back home.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.53,1:35:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,问他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask them.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.79,1:35:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕双方的积怨太深了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid there's too much bitterness on both sides.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.88,1:35:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,母子二人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother and son.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.13,1:35:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你安排的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You arranged this?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.43,1:35:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这能成为和解的第一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it might begin the healing process.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.15,1:35:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你在身边 我该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I going to do without you?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.82,1:35:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很想留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could stay,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.78,1:35:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是联邦现在正处于多事之秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}but these are perilous times for the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.12,1:35:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的一生都在保护家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't abandon it to people who would threaten.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.62,1:35:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在当然更不可能置之不理\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything that I've spent a lifetime defending.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.79,1:36:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须得回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go back,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.67,1:36:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,最起码能让联邦议会的节奏放慢下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}if only to slow things down at the Federation Council.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.80,1:36:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我马上就会有318天的休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have 318 days of shore leave coming and.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.18,1:36:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算申请休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend to use them.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.82,1:36:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.66,1:36:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.70,1:36:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该回家去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go home now.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.21,1:36:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.72,1:36:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据先生 希望能再见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Data, I hope we'll see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.15,1:37:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据！别忘了 每日都要玩耍一小会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Data! Don't forget. You have to have a little fun every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.41,1:37:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.50,1:37:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮卡特呼叫企业号 七人准备上船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picard to Enterprise. Seven to beam up.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.39,1:37:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,传送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Energize.
